3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference
for traditional Thai massage.]

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate
any of the techniques shown,]

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,001
