33
00:02:19,459 --> 00:02:21,080
Are you looking for someone to take your place on the boat?

34
00:02:21,598 --> 00:02:23,160
I can take your place. I won't even charge you.

35
00:02:24,619 --> 00:02:26,180
But you have to do something for me.

36
00:02:37,326 --> 00:02:38,760
Open the room for me. I'm going to take a nap.

37
00:02:56,003 --> 00:02:58,160
Oh, I ordered some food. It should be here soon.

38
00:02:59,486 --> 00:03:01,331
Hey, what are you doing?

39
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,201
I'm going to take a nap.

40
00:03:06,251 --> 00:03:07,252
Give me that.

41
00:04:01,758 --> 00:04:03,120
All right, go.

42
00:04:03,155 --> 00:04:04,250
Just go inside.

43
00:04:04,464 --> 00:04:06,165
- Go!
- Hurry up!

44
00:04:06,665 --> 00:04:07,666
Let's go.

45
00:04:08,166 --> 00:04:09,320
Come on.

46
00:04:39,398 --> 00:04:40,399
Dongyang.

47
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:44,800
You told me he would clear the route

48
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:47,081
from the border to Samut Prakan.

49
00:04:47,328 --> 00:04:50,496
I didn't pay a million dollar for him to sit around,

50
00:04:50,838 --> 00:04:52,864
making empty promises.

51
00:04:54,208 --> 00:04:58,840
That's why I brought everyone together today, Singh.

52
00:04:59,736 --> 00:05:02,320
All my men were busted at the checkpoint.

53
00:05:02,387 --> 00:05:05,120
My entire logistics network is ruined.

54
00:05:05,534 --> 00:05:06,535
I know.

55
00:05:06,712 --> 00:05:10,640
But let's wait and hear what he has to say, okay?

56
00:05:13,507 --> 00:05:16,180
Speak of the damn devil, here he comes.

57
00:05:56,392 --> 00:05:57,920
Your police are announcing

58
00:05:57,987 --> 00:06:00,880
they are going to expose our whole operation.

59
00:06:01,112 --> 00:06:02,200
What'd they have to say?

60
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,920
They're just doing what they're told.

61
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,080
It's all scripted.

62
00:06:08,611 --> 00:06:11,100
What about my men who got arrested?

63
00:06:11,395 --> 00:06:15,411
I've already set up a scapegoat for the police to close the case.

64
00:06:15,486 --> 00:06:16,487
Okay?

65
00:06:17,907 --> 00:06:18,908
Clear?

66
00:06:20,659 --> 00:06:21,880
I need to talk to you.

67
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:23,161
I need to talk to you, too.

68
00:06:25,507 --> 00:06:26,508
Enjoy.

69
00:06:34,824 --> 00:06:36,040
Hey, get out.

70
00:06:36,691 --> 00:06:37,692
All of you, out!

71
00:06:39,692 --> 00:06:40,693
Get out.

72
00:06:48,238 --> 00:06:51,640
You think saying that is enough to make this all go away?

73
00:06:53,843 --> 00:06:57,080
I warned you. The DSI's been watching you closely lately.

74
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,118
I told you to lie low, but you wouldn't listen.

75
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:03,504
So what? You can take my business elsewhere. I don't care.

76
00:07:05,448 --> 00:07:08,000
But when it comes to money laundering or human trafficking,

77
00:07:08,259 --> 00:07:10,670
