78
00:07:11,608 --> 00:07:12,609
Want to test that?

79
00:07:16,166 --> 00:07:17,167
Are you threatening me?

80
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:23,800
I'm warning you because we've known each other a long time.

81
00:07:25,275 --> 00:07:28,520
This really isn't the time to be making more enemies.

82
00:07:29,276 --> 00:07:30,720
You've already got so many,

83
00:07:32,128 --> 00:07:35,129
