188
00:20:21,296 --> 00:20:23,456
Mr. Dongyan! Mr. Dongyang!

189
00:20:35,654 --> 00:20:37,280
- Go get the AED!
- Okay.

190
00:21:23,254 --> 00:21:25,822
- Hey, I'm taking the girls back.
- Sure.

191
