You all can leave now.

192
00:22:32,763 --> 00:22:33,764
We need to talk.

193
00:22:39,696 --> 00:22:41,480
Give up on getting revenge on Dongyang.

194
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:44,075
Death isn't the answer to everything.

195
